+                            // our own consumer windows (multi-screen interleave): a
+                            // hide/show cycle makes the OS reassign activation, and the
+                            // reassignment search skips NOACTIVATE windows. If even
+                            // this fails, behaviour degrades exactly to the pre-0012
+                            // baseline — never worse.
+                            ShowWindow(hwnd, SW_HIDE);
